===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|nl|dum|clute}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|cloud||}}. Related to Dutch {{m|nl|kloot||ball; testicle}} and {{m|nl|klont||lump}}.

====Noun====
{{nl-noun|f|-en|+}}

# [[lump]], [[clod]] (mostly in connection to [[earth]] or [[soil]])

