* {{l|nl|graskluit}}
* {{l|nl|iemand met een kluitje in het riet sturen}}
* {{l|nl|rietkluit}}
* {{l|nl|uit de kluiten gewassen}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|af|kluit}}

===Etymology 2===
From earlier ''kluut'', through regular sound change, but again superseded by the older form (which is truer to the bird's call).

====Noun====
{{nl-noun|m|-en|+}}

# {{obsolete form of|nl|kluut}}

